    <p class="section-sub" data-en="From first site survey to grand opening day and beyond, DK handles it all." data-ar="من أول معاينة للموقع وحتى يوم الافتتاح وما بعده، تتولى DK كل شيء.">From first site survey to grand opening day and beyond, DK handles it all.</p>
  </div>

  <a href="#contact" class="prime-banner">
      <img class="prod-img" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Bowling"/>
    <div class="prime-banner-body">
      <span class="prime-badge" data-en="★ Prime offering" data-ar="★ عرض مميز">&#9733; Prime offering</span>
      <h3 data-en="👑 Private &amp; Palace Entertainment" data-ar="👑 ترفيه خاص للمنازل والقصور">&#128081; Private &amp; Palace Entertainment</h3>
      <p data-en="Bespoke bowling alleys, VR suites, Luxury Pool Tables and play areas designed for homes, villas and royal residences — fully confidential, white-glove service." data-ar="حلول بولينج وغرف واقع افتراضي وطاولات بلياردو فخمة ومناطق ألعاب مصممة خصيصاً للمنازل والفلل والقصور — خدمة راقية متكاملة.">Bespoke bowling alleys, VR suites, escape rooms and play areas designed for homes, villas and royal residences — fully confidential, white-glove service.</p>
      <span class="prime-link" data-en="Request a private consultation →" data-ar="← اطلب استشارة خاصة">Request a private consultation &#8594;</span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <div class="services-grid">
